    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ header file with declarations for the µTest++ counters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the <computeroutput>counters</computeroutput> class, which aggregates the counts of passed checks, failed checks, and executed test cases for a test runner, test suite, or test case. Instances of this class are embedded inside the runner and every node of the test tree, and updated in place as the test session progresses.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>The class is public, since <computeroutput>totals()</computeroutput> returns it, and the tests may read their own counters through it; the header itself is included through <computeroutput><ref refid="micro-test-plus_8h" kindref="compound">micro-test-plus.h</ref></computeroutput> and should not be included directly by user code. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
